          "y": 0,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 3
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "## \ud83d\udcca Parameter Explorer\nUse the **Machines** dropdown above to select one or more devices. All charts will populate with data for your selection across the chosen time range.\n\n> _Tip: hold Ctrl/Cmd to select multiple machines._"
        }
